  "patchVersionName": "v180-version-26282-dimension",
  "notes": [
    "Adds a visible version line so the phone can show the installed APK and patch version.",
    "Repairs the Zolano 2628 quick button label to show 26282 even when index.html is cached.",
    "Corrects MONTIERI ZL 2628 full-set measurement to show the L-shape footprint instead of one straight width.",
    "Removes the older duplicate ZL 2911 1.0 / 2.0 / 3.0 sale-row family so the same item no longer shows two prices.",
    "Keeps the Zolano quick-button and Pages manifest bridge patches in place.",
    "Leaves the existing 2628 and 3817 split-piece patch files in place."
